    "en": {
      "trackName": "GameZone: Mini Games",
      "description": "GameZone brings 31 mini games together in one app. Pick a logic puzzle, merge numbers, play a quick arcade round, or settle in with a card game whenever you have a few minutes.\n\nPUZZLES & LOGIC\nKlotski, Sliding Puzzle, Sokoban, Lights Maze, Memory Flip, Link Match, Link Dots, Color Sense, Queens Puzzle, Pipe Planet, Arrow Escape, and Pixel Logic.\n\nNUMBERS & BLOCKS\n2048, 2248 Merge, Emoji Merge, Sand Blast, Tetris, and Tetris 2.0.\n\nARCADE & REFLEX\nSnake, Flappy Bird, NinjaJump, Drop 1000, Stick Rush, Gap Needle, Don't Die, Color Ball, Piano Tiles, Fruit Slice, SWARM, and Brick Home.\n\nCARD CLASSIC\nSpider Solitaire.\n\nON IPHONE\nBrowse all the games, save favorites, and put them in your preferred order. Keep track of scores and check daily, weekly, or all-time leaderboards in supported games.\n\nON APPLE WATCH\nAll 31 games also have Watch versions built for short sessions on your wrist. Open recent games and continue a saved round. Once installed, you can play without internet and keep game progress locally on the Watch. Leaderboards need internet; syncing records with iPhone needs a connection between your devices.",
      "releaseNotes": "Six new games: SWARM, Brick Home, Queens Puzzle, Pipe Planet, Arrow Escape, and Pixel Logic.",
